      "level": 2,
      "content": "19. Quick Revision Points (RRB Focus)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "z9pjfi5",
      "content": "1. Darwin proposed Natural Selection."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6v3bh7w",
      "content": "2. Mutation is raw material of evolution."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zs4oxr8",
      "content": "3. Allopatric speciation involves geographical isolation."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "h2nq0ag",
      "content": "4. Fossils provide evidence of evolution."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ki9mkb9",
      "content": "5. Homologous organs show common ancestry."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "eilv0sj",
      "content": "6. Appendix is vestigial organ."
    }
  ],
